@MetadataApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5108

### Liveness (process health only; no database checks yet)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: text/plain

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Create an application
# @name createApplication
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inventory Portal",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "company": "Example Company",
  "website": "https://inventory.example.com",
  "source": "https://github.com/example/inventory",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "description": "Tracks inventory across warehouses."
}

### Read the application created above (REST Client response variable)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### List applications (defaults: limit 20, offset 0; ID ascending)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Accept: application/json

### Explicit page; follow nextOffset while it is not null
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications?limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Replace all metadata; omitted optional fields are cleared
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Microsoft Garage",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": "Garage locations and staff."
}

### Delete application and association links only (never maintainers)
DELETE {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}

### Missing replacement target: 404 (PUT does not create)
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Microsoft Garage"
}

### Missing deletion target: 404 (including repeat deletion)
DELETE {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

### Invalid pagination: 400 (not silently clamped)
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications?limit=101&offset=-1
Accept: application/json

### Invalid replacement: 400 (Title is required)
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": "2.0.0"
}

### ID is immutable: 400 (unknown request property)
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "title": "Microsoft Garage"
}

### Unsupported replacement media type: 415
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/{{createApplication.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: text/plain

Microsoft Garage

### Missing application: 404 Problem Details
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff
Accept: application/json

### Invalid application ID: 400 validation Problem Details
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json

### Invalid metadata: 400 with field-keyed errors
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "version": "v1",
  "website": "ftp://example.com"
}

### Create a maintainer
# @name createMaintainer
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garage Makers",
  "email": "Garage.Makers@example.com"
}

### Get the created maintainer
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers/{{createMaintainer.response.body.$.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Fully replace the maintainer's name and email
PUT {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers/{{createMaintainer.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garage Lab Team",
  "email": "Garage.Lab@example.com"
}

### List a bounded page ordered by ID ascending
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers?limit=20&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Delete the maintainer and links, not associated applications
DELETE {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers/{{createMaintainer.response.body.$.id}}

### Missing maintainer: 404 Problem Details
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff

### Invalid maintainer ID: 400 with field errors
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers/not-a-guid

### Invalid maintainer metadata: 400 with both field errors
POST {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "email": "Garage <garage@example.com>"
}

### Invalid pagination: 400, never clamped
GET {{MetadataApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/maintainers?limit=101&offset=10001
